  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "66",
  "tip": "<p>When a question targets scalability and performance with Google managed APIs, prefer the <i>official client libraries</i> because they provide <i>connection reuse</i> and <i>built in retries</i>. Options that add extra load balancers or proxies in front of Google APIs are usually distractors.</p>",
